==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has finally surpassed 89 million downloads worldwide!!<br>
A limited-time campaign will be held to commemorate this!<br>
{{Color|#FF5630|'''The event period is scheduled for January 29th (11:00) to February 12th (10:59), 2024!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Clear quickly by skipping battles! "Cat CPU Pack" appears!'''}}<br>
A great item pack containing lots of Cat CPUs and a Rare Ticket appears!

By consuming 2 Cat CPUS and energy, you can use the {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''"Battle Skip"'''}} feature to skip battles in cleared stages and get rewards!
Proceed through battles efficiently!

<small>※Each person can only purchase the "Cat CPU Pack" once during the period.<br>
※If the "Cat CPU Pack" is not displayed, you need to update the app to the latest version.<br>
※The Battle Skip function will be unlocked after clearing "Okinawa Prefecture" in "Japan Arc" Chapter 1.</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Get lots of XP! "Super Guerrilla XP Special" is held!'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, lots of guerrilla XP stages where you can get lots of XP appear!

{{Color|#00B8D9|'''・"XP Stage" appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF5630|'''【1/30, 2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11】・・・11：00～13：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF5630|'''【1/29, 1/31, 2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10】・・・19：00～21：59'''}}

