Take this opportunity to play the stages and get XP!

<small>※In addition the above schedule, each regular occurring stage will also appear.<br>
※"XP Megablitz!" is playable after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 3, "XP Colosseum" after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1, "Merciless XP!" after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 3, "XP Bonanza!" after clearing "Unleashing the Cats".</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●"Cat Ticket☆Festival" is held!'''}}<br>
Chance to get lots of Cat Tickets!<br>
The special stages {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''"Cat Ticket Chance!", "Siege of Hippoe!" and "Facing Danger"'''}} will appear at the following times during the event period!

{{Color|#00B8D9|'''・"Cat Ticket Chance!" and "Siege of Hippoe!" stage appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF5630|'''11:00～13:59 / 21:00～23:59'''}}

{{Color|#FF5630|'''"Facing Danger" appears as a guerrilla stage during the event!'''}}

Take this opportunity to get lots of Cat Tickets!!

<small>※The "Facing Danger" stage is a 1-time only stage that will disappear until the next event once the stage is cleared.</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●"Builder's Blitz" Event!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect materials needed for Cat Base development!<br>
The special stages {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Cavern of Comets", "Island of Ash" and "Strait of Wings"'''}} will appear at the following times during the event period!

{{Color|#FF5630|'''7:00～8:59 / 12:00～13:59 / 18:00～19:59 / 22:00～23:59'''}}

Take on this challenge each day, get lots of building materials!

<small>※All stages are playable after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1.<br>
※"Cavern of Comets", "Island of Ash" and "Strait of Wings" will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the times listed above.</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●"Treasure Fest☆Festival" is held!'''}}<br>
A limited-time {{Color|#FF5630|'''Treasure Festival'''}} will be held throughout the period, with a significant increase in Treasure drop rates!<br>
During the campaign period, it will be held on {{Color|#36B37E|'''even-numbered days'''}} in the {{Color|#36B37E|'''"Japan Arc"'''}} and {{Color|#6554C0|'''odd-numbered days'''}} in the {{Color|#6554C0|'''"Future Arc"'''}}!<br>

Plus, it will also be held in the {{Color|#0747A6|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}}！<br>
The {{Color|#0747A6|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}} Treasure Festival will be held on {{Color|#0747A6|'''1/31, 2/3, 2/6, 2/9, 2/12'''}}!<br>
<small>※"Japan Arc" and "Future Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1, "Cosmos Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1.</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Limited-time areas appear in "GAMATOTO Expedition!"'''}}<br>
The limited-time areas {{Color|#00B8D9|'''"Grand XP Harvest（Easy・Normal・Hard・Veteran）" and "Cats Eye Cave"'''}} appear in "GAMATOTO Expedition!"<br>
Chance to get more Catseyes and XP than usual!<br>
Don't miss this opportunity!

{{Color|#FF5630|'''・"Grand XP Harvest（Easy・Normal・Hard・Veteran）"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for January 29th (11:00) to February 5th (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF5630|'''・"Cats Eye Cave"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for February 5th (11:00) to February 12th (10:59)!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Limited campaign! "Catseye Limited Capsules" and "Catfruit Limited Capsules" appear!'''}}<br>
Take this chance to get lots of items and strengthen your characters!

{{Color|#FF5630|'''・"Catseye Limited Capsules"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for January 29th (11:00) to February 5th (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF5630|'''・"Catfruit Limited Capsules"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for February 5th (11:00) to February 12th (10:59)!

<small>※"Catseye Limited Capsules" provide Catseyes and XP, while "Catfruit Limited Capsules" provide Catfruit, XP and various items.<br>
※"Catseye Limited Capsules" will appear at User Rank 1600 and above, and "Catfruit Limited Capsules" will appear in the Cat Capsules after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 3.</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Daily Cat Food present！'''}}<br>
During the event period, open the "The Battle Cats" app for a
{{Color|#FF5630|'''daily 20 Cat Food'''}} present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!

